nderstand business and the existing legal and regulatory concepts<\/p><p>Led by attorneys <a href=\"https:\\/\\/bergppc.com\\/lawyers\/gil-melman\/\">Gil Melman<\/a> and <a href=\"https:\\/\\/bergppc.com\\/lawyers\/geoffrey-berg\/\">Geoff Berg<\/a>, our cryptocurrency business lawyers help set you up for long-term success employing blockchain technology in an evolving legal and regulatory landscape.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-245b6a2 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"245b6a2\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f82d558 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"f82d558\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-30ba338 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"30ba338\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Key Areas of Expertise<\/h3><ul><li>Cryptocurrency &amp; Blockchain Legal Advisory<\/li><li>Mergers &amp; Acquisitions (M&amp;A)<\/li><li>Smart Contracts &amp; Blockchain Transactions<\/li><li>Corporate Formation &amp; Governance<\/li><li>Commercial Agreements &amp; Licensing<\/li><li>Regulatory Compliance &amp; Risk Mitigation<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-af78859 elementor-align-left elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"af78859\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dpopup%3Aopen%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6IjM5OTgiLCJ0b2dnbGUiOmZhbHNlfQ%3D%3D\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Get Started<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-534b831 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"534b831\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-16ecdbe elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"16ecdbe\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"https:\\/\\/bergppc.com\\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/pexels-photo-14902679-14902679-1024x683.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-4443\" alt=\"A close-up image of Bitcoin cryptocurrency coins stacked on a neutral background, perfect for financial themes.\" srcset=\"https:\\/\\/bergppc.com\\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/pexels-photo-14902679-14902679-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https:\\/\\/bergppc.com\\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/pexels-photo-14902679-14902679-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/bergppc.com\\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/pexels-photo-14902679-14902679-768x512.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/bergppc.com\\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/pexels-photo-14902679-14902679-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https:\\/\\/bergppc.com\\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/pexels-photo-14902679-14902679-2048x1366.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1f4b000 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"1f4b000\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c13644a elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"c13644a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Crypto &amp; Blockchain is a Rapidly Evolving Legal &amp; Regulatory Landscape<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a6134d2 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"a6134d2\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ef5a4a0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ef5a4a0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>The legal environment surrounding cryptocurrency and blockchain is dynamic, uncertain, and increasingly scrutinized. Despite growing adoption, there is still no unified federal regulatory framework for digital assets in the U.S.<\/p><p>As noted in a recent <a href=\"https:\/\/legal.thomsonreuters.com\/blog\/cryptocurrency-laws\/\">Thomson Reuters<\/a> publication, \u201cNo defined regulation is used uniformly across all 50 states,\u201d creating a fragmented patchwork of federal and state laws that crypto and blockchain businesses must navigate carefully.<\/p><p>Federal agencies such as the SEC (Securities and Exchange Commission), CFTC (Commodity Futures Trading Commission), FinCEN (Financial Crimes Enforcement Network), and IRS (Internal Revenue Service) continue to assert overlapping jurisdiction over digital assets.<\/p><p>States are also stepping in with their own rules. The <a href=\"https:\/\/widgets.weforum.org\/blockchain-toolkit\/legal-and-regulatory-compliance\/index.html\">World Economic Forum<\/a> has highlighted the increasing number of jurisdictions implementing token-specific regulations, money transmitter licensing, and consumer protection rules for blockchain applications around the world and in the United States.<\/p><p>Legislation is moving through Congress to establish specific rules and regulations. Building on the House of Representatives passing <a href=\"https:\/\/www.congress.gov\/bill\/118th-congress\/house-bill\/4763\">FIT21<\/a>, the House Financial Services Committee recently advanced the <a href=\"https:\/\/financialservices.house.gov\/news\/documentsingle.aspx?DocumentID=409758\">CLARITY Act<\/a>, which seeks to \u201cestablish a regulatory framework for digital assets in the United States.\u201d Despite these legal and regulatory advances, crypto and blockchain is a developing area of law.<\/p><p>Stuart Davis, partner at Latham &amp; Watkins, a global law firm, <a href=\"https:\/\/widgets.weforum.org\/blockchain-toolkit\/legal-and-regulatory-compliance\/index.html\">writes<\/a>:<\/p><blockquote><p>There is no settled \u201claw of blockchain\u201d so we are interpreting existing legal and regulatory concepts in light of this new technology. As the scope and breadth of use cases increases, the legal certainty will also increase but this will take time. It is crucial for any project to embed legal and regulatory compliance into the design at the outset.<\/p><\/blockquote><p>In this fast-changing environment, legal guidance is essential. Businesses using blockchain and crypto assets need attorneys who understand existing legal and regulatory concepts and can track shifting regulations, interpret ambiguous rules, and design legal strategies that anticipate enforcement risks before they arise.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9e6ecbd e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"9e6ecbd\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ec4f86f e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"ec4f86f\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-89d03d8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"89d03d8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"https:\\/\\/bergppc.com\\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/pexels-photo-8370752-8370752-1-1024x683.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-4445\" alt=\"Close-up of gold and silver cryptocurrency coins on a digital trading chart.\" srcset=\"https:\\/\\/bergppc.com\\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/pexels-photo-8370752-8370752-1-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https:\\/\\/bergppc.com\\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/pexels-photo-8370752-8370752-1-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\\/\\/bergppc.com\\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/pexels-photo-8370752-8370752-1-768x512.jpg 768w, https:\\/\\/bergppc.com\\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/pexels-photo-8370752-8370752-1-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https:\\/\\/bergppc.com\\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/pexels-photo-8370752-8370752-1-2048x1365.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5f98c85 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"5f98c85\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fd0eda5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"fd0eda5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type