iv class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9894a9c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9894a9c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>While our trial firm is well known for business litigation and prosecuting <a href=\"https:\\/\\/bergppc.com\\/practice-areas\/crypto-litigation\/fraud-recovery\/\">crypto fraud and recovery<\/a> claims under <a href=\"https:\\/\\/bergppc.com\\/lawyers\/geoffrey-berg\/\">Geoff Berg\u2019s<\/a> leadership, we also serve crypto and blockchain businesses through transactional counsel led by attorney <a href=\"https:\\/\\/bergppc.com\\/lawyers\/gil-melman\/\">Gil Melman<\/a>.<\/p><p>Together, Gil, Geoff, and their team bring a rare combination of global corporate experience, high-stakes commercial litigation, and blockchain fluency to their crypto clients.<\/p><p>Before joining Berg PC, Gil spent over 32 years honing his skills in the world of corporate law, quickly building a reputation as a go-to expert for large-scale, high-value transactions. He practiced corporate and M&amp;A law at international firms and held leadership roles at public companies.<\/p><p>Since forming Berg PC in 2001, Geoff has worked with and against some of the best regional and national commercial trial firms, racking up a string of major trial wins. He has extensive experience handling matters himself at every stage of litigation, from filing lawsuits through appeals in courts across Texas.<\/p><p>Their combined approach to cryptocurrency law blends vast corporate and litigation experience with an in-depth understanding of digital asset regulations, market dynamics, and emerging technologies.<\/p><p>Gil, Geoff and their team of crypto and blockchain attorneys advise entrepreneurs, developers, and investors on how to structure, launch, and scale blockchain projects while navigating SEC, CFTC, FinCEN, and state-level compliance frameworks.<\/p><p>While our team works to keep you and your business out of the courtroom, we prepare thoroughly for the prospect of litigation and are willing and able to try a case to its conclusion, if necessary.<\/p><h3>What Sets Our Team Apart<\/h3><ul><li><strong>Decades of Expertise<\/strong>: With decades of experience in commercial and transactional law, Gil and Geoff have developed an unparalleled ability to handle even the most sophisticated and high-stakes deals.<\/li><li><strong>Trial Ready<\/strong>: Our extensive experience in litigation and transactional law reduce the likelihood of you and your business going to trial. If you go to court, we are ready to fight for you before, during and after trial because we think about trial strategy from the outset.<\/li><li><strong>Cutting-Edge Cryptocurrency Knowledge<\/strong>: Our deep dive into cryptocurrency law ensures that you receive the most up-to-date advice on navigating the regulatory, legal, and business challenges of the digital asset space.<\/li><li><strong>Strategic Business Insight<\/strong>: Our background in both large law firms and in-house legal teams means Gil and Geoff understands not only the law but also the business considerations that drive successful transactions.<\/li><li><strong>Tailored Solutions<\/strong>: Gil and Geoff work directly with clients to craft solutions that are specifically aligned with their objectives, ensuring the right balance of legal protection and business opportunity.<\/li><li><strong>Trusted Advisor<\/strong>: Whether you\u2019re a startup, established business, or investor, Gil and Geoff are committed to building long-term relationships based on trust, transparency, and a shared vision for success.<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6036de7 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"6036de7\" d