6x2048.jpg 1536w, https:\\/\\/bergppc.com\\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/pexels-photo-17433216-17433216-scaled.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4f4e5de e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"4f4e5de\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-40954e0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"40954e0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\">We are instrumental in providing commercially savvy legal leadership to the organization at its earliest stage, both as a general counsel and in connection with its structure and financing, including:<\/p><ul><li data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\">Structuring the organization for optimum fundraising capability while balancing and protecting the founder\u2019s significant sweat equity interest.<\/li><li data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\">Providing legal guidance on managing the requirements of federal and state regulatory agencies and the exemption from specific provisions of the Bank Secrecy Act.<\/li><li data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\">Advising the company on how to structure itself so that it doesn\u2019t inadvertently qualify as a money transmitter under the Bank Secrecy Act.<\/li><li data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\">Drafting the company\u2019s terms of use, client agreements, and negotiating its merchant agreements with financial institutions as part of its product offering.<\/li><li data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\">Negotiating the company\u2019s senior credit facility and its relationship with its key financial advisor in connection with its fundraising.<\/li><li data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\">Protecting the company\u2019s intellectual property in a separate holding company owned solely by the founder.<\/li><li data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\">Working on the company\u2019s HR matters, including the preparation of offer letters, equity grants, non-disclosure agreements, and board advisory agreements.\u00a0<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6ac6c18 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"6ac6c18\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cfe90e3 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"cfe90e3\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cc10a8d e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"cc10a8d\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6168aec e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"6168aec\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6d2e958 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"6d2e958\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Cryptocurrency Business Lawyer in Houston, Texas<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-de6aab1 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"de6aab1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\